{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03982","headline":"三月三日宴王明府山亭 · 崔知贤","name":"三月三日宴王明府山亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"京洛皇居，芳禊春余。\n影媚元巳，和风上除。\n云开翠帟，水鹜鲜居。\n林渚萦暎，烟霞卷舒。\n花飘粉蝶，藻跃文鱼。\n沿波式宴，其乐只且。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔知贤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03982.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03982","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}